
## ML / Data

- **Datasets:** {{DATASETS}} <!-- where they live and how to fetch them -->
- **Train:** `{{TRAIN_COMMAND}}`
- **Evaluate:** `{{EVAL_COMMAND}}`
- **Notebooks:** `{{NOTEBOOK_COMMAND}}`
- **Experiment tracker:** {{TRACKER}} <!-- MLflow / Weights & Biases / none -->
- **Hardware:** {{HARDWARE}} <!-- CPU / CUDA / MPS -->
- **Model artifacts:** {{ARTIFACT_PATH}} <!-- where trained weights are written -->

### Conventions
Seeds set and logged, runs recorded with config + git SHA, never evaluate on training data,
raw data and weights stay out of git. Full rules: `.claude/rules/shipkit/ml/`.
